  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "Fee Waiver",
    "long_instructions": "\r\n## Fee Waiver\r\n\r\n**Eligibility Criteria:**\r\nA student is **eligible** if their **income is below $45,000** **or** their **family has 5 or more members**, and they **do not owe past-due fees**.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Review the numeric input fields in the starter code: `income`, `familySize`, and the checkbox `feesDue`.\r\n\r\n2. Write the `eligible()` function so it updates the eligibility message (`message`) based on whether the current input values meet the criteria.\r\n\r\n3. In the event handler for the **Run** button (`runBtn`), call `eligible()` to test the current inputs.\r\n",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/2bac91ddbbe28962c7f8a161f13dd64d-fee.png",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
